# BinaryBuilder scratch from testing yggdrasil/build_tarballs.jl locally.
# These hold unpacked JLL artifacts, whose vendored docs and shell scripts
# otherwise get picked up by `dprint`/`shellcheck` and fail the pre-commit hook.
# The recipe drops them next to whichever directory it was invoked from.
/build/
/products/
/yggdrasil/build/
/yggdrasil/products/

